{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join Molly on this pirate-themed romp to collect candy!\u00a0 But be careful, ghosts and other undead forces are out to stop you!\u00a0 You'll need quick reflexes and quick thinking to be able to out-maneuver the ghost pirates and collect all the confectionary-treasure you can!\u00a0 This is a game that no fan of the classics should miss!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gameplay styled after the golden age of arcade games!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">45 levels!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple styles of gameplay to keep things fresh!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn high scores!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hand-drawn artwork!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_strike\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No AI generation (machine learning) was used in creating this game.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3522190?t=1740852478","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522190/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740852478","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522190/334af4a8a6f96b20e100fe8f4c54b3cdfb128973/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740852478","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522190/334af4a8a6f96b20e100fe8f4c54b3cdfb128973/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740852478","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join Molly on this pirate-themed romp to collec